@serverUrl = http://localhost:3333

### Coloque os PDFs reais em ./seed-assets com estes nomes antes de enviar.
### As respostas de upload são vinculadas aos itens estáveis criados pelo seed.

### Contrato societário (quote 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6)
# @name uploadContratoSocietario
POST {{serverUrl}}/api/quotes/upload-document
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----CodexSeedDocument

------CodexSeedDocument
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="contrato-societario.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./seed-assets/contrato-societario.pdf
------CodexSeedDocument--

### Vincular contrato societário ao item de tradução
PATCH {{serverUrl}}/api/quotes/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6/translation-items/72dc6f7e-cf14-44c3-972a-c2cd0a64fbeb
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "file_url": "{{uploadContratoSocietario.response.body.$.file_url}}"
}

